In this folder you will find the submission scripts for each of the .sh files in the tools directory. This helps make the workflow run smoothly as it submits one job per sample and runs it in parallel.

e.g. 01_seqprep.sh runs the 01_bbsplit_clean_norm.slurm tool on each sample (for sample in $(cut -f1 /your/path/sample.list); do bbsplit_clean_norm.slurm).

Note. Step 06_getMDS_matrix_from_dist.sh calls an R script that comes with ngsTools, you will need to direct it according to your folder (your/path/ngsTools/Scripts/getMDS.R)
